      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01245",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"你说美是怨敌？\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You say beauty is an enemy?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01245",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "柏木带夸张地瞪大眼睛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kashiwagi opened his eyes wide in an exaggerated way.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01245",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他那张红润的脸恢复了往常的哲学式的爽快神色。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His ruddy face regained its usual philosophically brisk expression.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01245",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "\"这是多么大的变化啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What a tremendous change this is.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01245",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "从你的嘴里听到这番话，我也必须重新调整自己的认识光圈了。\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hearing those words from your mouth, I too must readjust the aperture of my own understanding.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
